    "no_demo_hidden: no WorkoutX demo yet (checked with scripts/wx-lookup.mjs, 23 Nov 2026). Hidden from the library and the workout builder, and removed from swap lists, so she's never sent to an exercise she can't see. Remove an id from this list when its demo is added."
